Most recent RTOFS output is at https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/pub/data/nccf/com/rtofs/prod/rtofs.YYYYMMDD
where YYYYMMDD is the 8 digit date, 20220201 today.

The last year, maybe more, is at https://noaa-nws-rtofs-pds.s3.amazonaws.com/index.html

The files to use are rtofs_glo_2ds_fHHH_ice.nc
where f is forecast, HHH is hours, 
  000 to 072 by 1, 
  072 to 192 by 3 hour steps.

Also rtofs_glo_2ds_nHHH_ice.nc
where n is nowcast, and hours is hours before now HHH is 
  000 to 024 by 1

